    <string name="health_explainer_title">What Nocturne does with Health Connect</string>
    <string name="health_explainer_read">Reads, if you turn on the overlay: your sleep stages from other apps, shown behind History. They are read when you open History and are not saved, backed up or exported.</string>
    <string name="health_explainer_write">Writes, if you turn on export: completed nights the BedJet confirmed, as “BedJet programme ran”. That is programme time, not measured sleep.</string>
    <string name="health_explainer_never">Never: Health Connect does not control your BedJet. Both are off by default, and you can revoke access in Health Connect at any time.</string>
